<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>LUMEN & SCENT | Nến Thơm Chữa Lành Cá Nhân Hóa (TMA306 Demo)</title>
    <!-- Google Fonts: Import các font đa dạng để giáo viên và nhóm kiểm tra đổi font -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Be+Vietnam+Pro:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;1,400&family=Dancing+Script:wght@600;700&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Montserrat:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            darkMode: 'class',
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        theme: {
                            primary: 'var(--primary-color)',
                            primaryHover: 'var(--primary-hover)',
                            accent: 'var(--accent-color)',
                            surface: 'var(--surface-color)',
                            bg: 'var(--bg-color)',
                            text: 'var(--text-color)',
                            subtext: 'var(--subtext-color)',
                            border: 'var(--border-color)',
                        }
                    },
                    borderRadius: {
                        'custom': 'var(--radius)',
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    <!-- Lucide Icons -->
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest"></script>
    <style>
        :root {
            /* Theme Palettes mặc định: Amber & Warm Soy */
            --primary-color: #b45309;       /* Amber 700 */
            --primary-hover: #92400e;       /* Amber 800 */
            --accent-color: #d97706;        /* Amber 600 */
            --bg-color: #faf8f5;            /* Kem sáp ấm áp */
            --surface-color: #ffffff;
            --text-color: #292524;          /* Stone 800 */
            --subtext-color: #78716c;       /* Stone 500 */
            --border-color: #e7e5e4;        /* Stone 200 */
            --radius: 12px;
            --font-heading: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            --font-body: 'Be Vietnam Pro', sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-color);
            font-family: var(--font-body);
            transition: background-color 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease;
        }

        h1, h2, h3, h4, .font-heading {
            font-family: var(--font-heading);
        }

        .theme-surface {
            background-color: var(--surface-color);
            border-color: var(--border-color);
        }

        /* Hiệu ứng ngọn lửa nến nhấp nháy động */
        @keyframes flicker {
            0%, 100% { transform: scale(1) rotate(-1deg); opacity: 0.95; }
            25% { transform: scale(1.08, 0.95) rotate(1deg); opacity: 0.85; }
            50% { transform: scale(0.92, 1.05) rotate(-2deg); opacity: 1; }
            75% { transform: scale(1.05, 0.98) rotate(2deg); opacity: 0.9; }
        }

        .candle-flame {
            animation: flicker 1.4s infinite alternate ease-in-out;
            transform-origin: bottom center;
            box-shadow: 0 0 25px 8px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.45);
        }

        /* Hiệu ứng kính mờ glassmorphism */
        .glass-panel {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        }

        .dark .glass-panel {
            background: rgba(28, 25, 23, 0.88);
        }

        /* Thanh cuộn mềm */
        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: rgba(160, 150, 140, 0.3); border-radius: 99px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="antialiased min-h-screen relative selection:bg-amber-200 selection:text-amber-900">

    <!-- ======================================================== -->
    <!-- 0. THANH ĐIỀU KHIỂN SỬA FONT & ĐỔI MÀU TRỰC TIẾP (CÔ YÊU CẦU) -->
    <!-- ======================================================== -->
    <div id="themeStudio" class="fixed bottom-5 right-5 z-50 flex flex-col items-end">
        <!-- Nút toggle mở bảng điều khiển -->
        <button id="toggleStudioBtn" onclick="toggleStudio()" class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-stone-900 text-white px-4 py-3 rounded-full shadow-2xl hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 transition-all border border-stone-700">
            <i data-lucide="palette" class="w-5 h-5 text-amber-400"></i>
            <span class="font-medium text-sm">Bộ Tùy Biến Giao Diện (Cô Yêu Cầu)</span>
            <span class="flex h-2.5 w-2.5 relative">
                <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-amber-400 opacity-75"></span>
                <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2.5 w-2.5 bg-amber-500"></span>
            </span>
        </button>

        <!-- Hộp Modal Điều Khiển Giao Diện Trực Tiếp -->
        <div id="studioPanel" class="hidden mt-3 w-96 glass-panel rounded-2xl shadow-2xl border border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-700 p-5 text-stone-800 dark:text-stone-100 transition-all max-h-[85vh] overflow-y-auto">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-3 border-b border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i data-lucide="sliders" class="w-5 h-5 text-amber-600"></i>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-base">Live Theme & Typography Studio</h3>
                </div>
                <button onclick="toggleStudio()" class="text-stone-400 hover:text-stone-600 p-1">
                    <i data-lucide="x" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                </button>
            </div>

            <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-2 mb-4">
                *Thay đổi tức thời toàn bộ phông chữ, bảng màu, bo góc trên trang để demo trực quan trước giảng viên.
            </p>

            <!-- 1. Chọn Bảng Màu Mẫu (Color Presets) -->
            <div class="mb-4">
                <label class="block text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-500 mb-2">1. Bảng màu thương hiệu (Palettes)</label>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2">
                    <button onclick="setPalette('amber')" class="flex items-center gap-2 p-2 rounded-lg border border-amber-300 bg-amber-50/50 hover:bg-amber-100/50 text-xs font-medium text-left">
                        <span class="w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-amber-600 inline-block shadow-sm"></span>
                        <span>Hổ phách ấm (Mặc định)</span>
                    </button>
                    <button onclick="setPalette('sage')" class="flex items-center gap-2 p-2 rounded-lg border border-emerald-300 bg-emerald-50/50 hover:bg-emerald-100/50 text-xs font-medium text-left">
                        <span class="w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-emerald-700 inline-block shadow-sm"></span>
                        <span>Xô thơm & Rêu (Sage Zen)</span>
                    </button>
                    <button onclick="setPalette('rose')" class="flex items-center gap-2 p-2 rounded-lg border border-rose-300 bg-rose-50/50 hover:bg-rose-100/50 text-xs font-medium text-left">
                        <span class="w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-rose-600 inline-block shadow-sm"></span>
                        <span>Hoa hồng & Velvet</span>
                    </button>
                    <button onclick="setPalette('terracotta')" class="flex items-center gap-2 p-2 rounded-lg border border-orange-300 bg-orange-50/50 hover:bg-orange-100/50 text-xs font-medium text-left">
                        <span class="w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-orange-800 inline-block shadow-sm"></span>
                        <span>Gốm đất nung mộc</span>
                    </button>
                    <button onclick="setPalette('midnight')" class="flex items-center gap-2 p-2 rounded-lg border border-indigo-300 bg-indigo-50/50 hover:bg-indigo-100/50 text-xs font-medium text-left col-span-2">
                        <span class="w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-indigo-900 inline-block shadow-sm"></span>
                        <span>Dạ khúc đen & Vàng Gold (Luxury Night)</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 2. Chọn Tự Do Màu Primary & Accent -->
            <div class="mb-4 pt-3 border-t border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700">
                <label class="block text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-500 mb-2">Tùy biến mã màu bất kỳ (Color Picker)</label>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                        <input type="color" id="primaryPicker" value="#b45309" onchange="updateCustomColor('primary', this.value)" class="w-8 h-8 rounded border cursor-pointer">
                        <span class="text-xs">Màu chủ đạo</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                        <input type="color" id="accentPicker" value="#d97706" onchange="updateCustomColor('accent', this.value)" class="w-8 h-8 rounded border cursor-pointer">
                        <span class="text-xs">Màu nhấn</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 3. Chọn Font Tiêu Đề (Heading Fonts) -->
            <div class="mb-4 pt-3 border-t border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700">
                <label class="block text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-500 mb-2">2. Font Tiêu đề (Heading Font)</label>
                <select id="headingFontSelect" onchange="changeHeadingFont(this.value)" class="w-full text-xs p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-600 bg-white dark:bg-stone-800">
                    <option value="'Playfair Display', serif" selected>Playfair Display (Sang trọng, Cổ điển)</option>
                    <option value="'Cormorant Garamond', serif">Cormorant Garamond (Nghệ thuật, Thơ mộng)</option>
                    <option value="'Dancing Script', cursive">Dancing Script (Thủ công, Chữ viết tay)</option>
                    <option value="'Montserrat', sans-serif">Montserrat (Trẻ trung, Hiện đại)</option>
                    <option value="'Be Vietnam Pro', sans-serif">Be Vietnam Pro (Tối giản chuẩn Việt)</option>
                    <option value="'Space Grotesk', sans-serif">Space Grotesk (Cá tính, Công nghệ)</option>
                </select>
            </div>

            <!-- 4. Chọn Font Nội Dung (Body Fonts) -->
            <div class="mb-4">
                <label class="block text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-500 mb-2">3. Font Văn bản (Body Font)</label>
                <select id="bodyFontSelect" onchange="changeBodyFont(this.value)" class="w-full text-xs p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-600 bg-white dark:bg-stone-800">
                    <option value="'Be Vietnam Pro', sans-serif" selected>Be Vietnam Pro (Dễ đọc tiếng Việt)</option>
                    <option value="'Inter', sans-serif">Inter (Chuẩn giao diện quốc tế)</option>
                    <option value="'Montserrat', sans-serif">Montserrat (Rõ nét, Tươi trẻ)</option>
                </select>
            </div>

            <!-- 5. Bo góc (Border Radius) -->
            <div class="mb-4 pt-3 border-t border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700">
                <label class="block text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-500 mb-2">4. Phong cách bo góc (Corners)</label>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-4 gap-1.5 text-center text-xs">
                    <button onclick="setRadius('0px')" class="p-1.5 border rounded border-stone-300 hover:bg-stone-100 dark:hover:bg-stone-800">Vuông (0px)</button>
                    <button onclick="setRadius('8px')" class="p-1.5 border rounded-lg border-stone-300 hover:bg-stone-100 dark:hover:bg-stone-800">Nhẹ (8px)</button>
                    <button onclick="setRadius('16px')" class="p-1.5 border rounded-2xl border-stone-300 hover:bg-stone-100 dark:hover:bg-stone-800 font-semibold bg-stone-100 dark:bg-stone-700">Mềm (16px)</button>
                    <button onclick="setRadius('28px')" class="p-1.5 border rounded-full border-stone-300 hover:bg-stone-100 dark:hover:bg-stone-800">Tròn (Pill)</button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 6. Dark / Light Ambient Mode -->
            <div class="pt-3 border-t border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700 flex items-center justify-between">
                <span class="text-xs font-semibold">Chế độ Ánh nến ban đêm (Dark)</span>
                <button onclick="toggleDarkMode()" class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-stone-200 dark:bg-stone-700 hover:scale-105 transition-all">
                    <i data-lucide="moon" class="w-4 h-4 dark:hidden"></i>
                    <i data-lucide="sun" class="w-4 h-4 hidden dark:block text-amber-400"></i>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ======================================================== -->
    <!-- 1. HEADER & NAVIGATION (7C: CONTEXT & CONNECTION) -->
    <!-- ======================================================== -->
    <header class="sticky top-0 z-40 glass-panel border-b border-stone-200/80 dark:border-stone-800 transition-all">
        <!-- Dải thông báo ưu đãi / chính sách bền vững Refill -->
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-800 via-amber-700 to-amber-900 text-white text-xs py-1.5 px-4 text-center font-medium tracking-wide flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
            <span class="bg-amber-500/30 text-amber-200 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-[10px] font-bold uppercase">ESG / Bền vững</span>
            <span>Chương trình "Tái sinh hũ cũ": Trả lại vỏ nến cũ nhận voucher giảm 20% mã <strong>REFILL20</strong></span>
        </div>

        <nav class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-20 flex items-center justify-between">
            <!-- Brand Logo -->
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-custom flex items-center justify-center text-white shadow-md transition-all" style="background-color: var(--primary-color);">
                    <i data-lucide="flame" class="w-6 h-6"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <span class="font-heading font-bold text-2xl tracking-tight block leading-tight">LUMEN & SCENT</span>
                    <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-theme-subtext font-semibold block">Crafted Mood & Zodiac Candles</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Menu Navigation -->
            <div class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 text-sm font-medium">
                <a href="#customizer" class="text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300 hover:text-amber-600 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5">
                    <i data-lucide="wand-2" class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-600"></i>
                    <span>Tự Phối Nến 3D</span>
                </a>
                <a href="#quiz" class="text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300 hover:text-amber-600 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5">
                    <i data-lucide="sparkles" class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-600"></i>
                    <span>Quiz Tìm Mùi Hương</span>
                </a>
                <a href="#bundle" class="text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300 hover:text-amber-600 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5">
                    <i data-lucide="gift" class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-600"></i>
                    <span>Combo Quà Tặng</span>
                </a>
                <a href="#story" class="text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300 hover:text-amber-600 transition-colors">
                    Câu Chuyện Lành
                </a>
                <a href="#reviews" class="text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300 hover:text-amber-600 transition-colors">
                    Đánh Giá (4.9★)
                </a>
            </div>

            <!-- Right Actions: Sound Synthesizer + Cart -->
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <!-- Nút bật âm thanh lửa cháy tí tách bấc gỗ (Woodwick Crackle Synthesizer) -->
                <button id="soundBtn" onclick="toggleFireSound()" title="Nghe tiếng bấc gỗ tí tách (Web Audio)" class="flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 rounded-full border border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-700 hover:border-amber-500 bg-white dark:bg-stone-800 text-xs font-medium transition-all shadow-sm">
                    <i id="soundIcon" data-lucide="volume-x" class="w-4 h-4 text-stone-500"></i>
                    <span id="soundText" class="hidden sm:inline">Âm thanh bấc gỗ: Tắt</span>
                </button>

                <!-- Giỏ hàng -->
                <button onclick="toggleCartDrawer()" class="relative p-2.5 rounded-full text-white shadow-md hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 transition-all" style="background-color: var(--primary-color);">
                    <i data-lucide="shopping-bag" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
                    <span id="cartCount" class="absolute -top-1 -right-1 bg-amber-400 text-stone-900 font-bold text-xs w-5 h-5 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center border-2 border-white shadow">0</span>
                </button>
            </div>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <!-- ======================================================== -->
    <!-- 2. HERO SECTION (7C: CONTENT & CONTEXT) -->
    <!-- ======================================================== -->
    <section class="relative overflow-hidden py-16 md:py-24">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
                <!-- Content Left -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
                    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide bg-amber-100 text-amber-900 dark:bg-amber-950/80 dark:text-amber-300 border border-amber-300/60">
                        <i data-lucide="sparkle" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-amber-600"></i>
                        <span>Đồ án TMĐT TMA306: D2C Personalized Emotional Fragrance</span>
                    </div>

                    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.15]">
                        Thắp Sáng Cảm Xúc, <br>
                        <span class="italic font-normal underline decoration-amber-400 decoration-wavy decoration-2">Khắc Tên Kỷ Niệm</span> Của Riêng Bạn.
                    </h1>

                    <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-theme-subtext max-w-xl font-normal leading-relaxed">
                        Nến thơm thủ công từ 100% sáp đậu nành thiên nhiên. Tự do phối 2 tầng hương theo tâm trạng, khắc tên người nhận, in thông điệp bí mật và chọn ngày giao quà tận tay.
                    </p>

                    <!-- CTAs -->
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 pt-2">
                        <a href="#customizer" class="px-7 py-3.5 rounded-custom font-semibold text-white shadow-lg shadow-amber-900/20 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 transition-all flex items-center gap-2" style="background-color: var(--primary-color);">
                            <i data-lucide="wand-2" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
                            <span>Tự Phối Hũ Nến Của Bạn (Live 3D)</span>
                        </a>
                        <a href="#quiz" class="px-6 py-3.5 rounded-custom font-semibold border-2 border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-700 hover:border-amber-600 bg-transparent text-stone-800 dark:text-stone-200 transition-all flex items-center gap-2">
                            <i data-lucide="compass" class="w-5 h-5 text-amber-600"></i>
                            <span>Quiz Tìm Mùi Phù Hợp (2 phút)</span>
                        </a>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Trust Indicators & Social Proof -->
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-6 border-t border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800">
                        <div>
                            <div class="font-heading font-bold text-2xl text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400">100%</div>
                            <div class="text-xs text-stone-500 font-medium">Sáp đậu nành sinh học</div>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <div class="font-heading font-bold text-2xl text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400">0.0 CO₂</div>
                            <div class="text-xs text-stone-500 font-medium">Bấc gỗ hữu cơ tí tách</div>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <div class="font-heading font-bold text-2xl text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400">&gt;22% CAGR</div>
                            <div class="text-xs text-stone-500 font-medium">Tăng trưởng ngành nến VN</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Hero Visual Right: Interactive Candle Card Showcase -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative flex justify-center">
                    <div class="w-full max-w-md p-8 rounded-3xl glass-panel shadow-2xl border border-stone-200/80 dark:border-stone-800 text-center relative overflow-hidden">
                        <!-- Background glow effect -->
                        <div class="absolute -top-20 -right-20 w-48 h-48 bg-amber-400/20 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
                        <div class="absolute -bottom-20 -left-20 w-48 h-48 bg-rose-400/20 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>

                        <!-- Candle 3D-like simulation inside Hero -->
                        <div class="relative py-6 flex flex-col items-center">
                            <!-- Ngọn lửa -->
                            <div id="heroFlame" class="w-5 h-10 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-t from-amber-600 via-amber-400 to-yellow-100 candle-flame mb-2 shadow-amber-500/50"></div>
                            <!-- Bấc gỗ -->
                            <div class="w-1.5 h-3 bg-amber-950 rounded-sm"></div>
                            
                            <!-- Thân hũ nến -->
                            <div class="w-56 h-64 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-800 via-amber-900 to-stone-900 p-4 shadow-2xl border border-amber-700/40 relative flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-amber-50">
                                <!-- Nhãn nến phong cách Typography cổ điển -->
                                <div class="w-44 h-48 border border-amber-300/40 p-3 rounded-lg flex flex-col justify-between items-center bg-stone-900/60 backdrop-blur-sm text-center">
                                    <div class="text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-300/80 font-bold border-b border-amber-300/20 pb-1 w-full">
                                        LUMEN & SCENT NO. 07
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="my-auto space-y-1">
                                        <div class="text-2xl font-heading italic text-amber-200">Thanh Trúc</div>
                                        <div class="text-[10px] text-amber-100/90 font-light italic">"Mong mọi mệt mỏi đều tan biến"</div>
                                        <div class="text-[11px] text-amber-300 flex items-center justify-center gap-1 font-semibold">
                                            <span>♈ Aries (Bạch Dương)</span>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="text-[8px] uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-400/70 border-t border-amber-300/20 pt-1 w-full">
                                        Lavender & Sandalwood • 200g
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="mt-4 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-stone-500">
                            <span class="flex items-center gap-1 text-emerald-600 font-semibold">
                                <i data-lucide="check-circle" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i> Live Preview 100% Real
                            </span>
                            <span class="italic font-serif">Mẫu nến cá nhân hóa</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ======================================================== -->
    <!-- 3. EXTENSION 1: LIVE 3D/REAL-TIME CANDLE & LABEL CUSTOMIZER -->
    <!-- ======================================================== -->
    <section id="customizer" class="py-16 theme-surface border-y border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 transition-colors">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">
                <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-white" style="background-color: var(--primary-color);">
                    Extension 1: Live Interactive Customizer
                </span>
                <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold mt-3 mb-4">Studio Thiết Kế Hũ Nến Độc Bản Của Riêng Bạn</h2>
                <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-theme-subtext">
                    Tùy chỉnh chất liệu hũ, chọn bấc nến, nhập tên người nhận, thông điệp bí mật và chọn biểu tượng Cung hoàng đạo. Bạn có thể xem trước sản phẩm thực tế thời gian thực trước khi đặt hàng.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start">
                <!-- Cột trái: Bộ điều khiển Customizer -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-7 bg-white dark:bg-stone-900 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xl border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 space-y-6">
                    
                    <!-- Bước 1: Chọn chất liệu hũ nến -->
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-300 mb-2.5">
                            Bước 1: Chọn chất liệu & kiểu dáng hũ nến
                        </label>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3">
                            <button onclick="setJarType('amber')" id="jarBtn-amber" class="jar-option-btn p-3 rounded-2xl border-2 border-amber-600 bg-amber-50/50 dark:bg-amber-950/20 text-left transition-all">
                                <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-amber-900 mb-1.5 shadow-sm"></div>
                                <div class="text-xs font-bold">Thủy tinh hổ phách</div>
                                <div class="text-[10px] text-stone-500">Kinh điển, ấm áp</div>
                            </button>
                            <button onclick="setJarType('ceramic')" id="jarBtn-ceramic" class="jar-option-btn p-3 rounded-2xl border-2 border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700 hover:border-amber-400 text-left transition-all">
                                <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-stone-300 mb-1.5 shadow-sm"></div>
                                <div class="text-xs font-bold">Gốm mộc Bát Tràng</div>
                                <div class="text-[10px] text-stone-500">+25.000đ (Upcycled)</div>
                            </button>
                            <button onclick="setJarType('cement')" id="jarBtn-cement" class="jar-option-btn p-3 rounded-2xl border-2 border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700 hover:border-amber-400 text-left transition-all">
                                <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-stone-600 mb-1.5 shadow-sm"></div>
                                <div class="text-xs font-bold">Xi măng Terrazzo</div>
                                <div class="text-[10px] text-stone-500">+30.000đ (Industrial)</div>
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Bước 2: Chọn bấc nến -->
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-300 mb-2.5">
                            Bước 2: Chọn loại bấc nến
                        </label>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                            <button onclick="setWick('wood')" id="wickBtn-wood" class="wick-option-btn p-3 rounded-2xl border-2 border-amber-600 bg-amber-50/50 dark:bg-amber-950/20 text-left transition-all">
                                <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1">
                                    <span class="text-xs font-bold">Bấc gỗ tự nhiên (Wood Wick)</span>
                                    <i data-lucide="music" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-amber-600"></i>
                                </div>
                                <div class="text-[10px] text-stone-500">Cháy nổ tí tách êm dịu, không khói đen</div>
                            </button>
                            <button onclick="setWick('cotton')" id="wickBtn-cotton" class="wick-option-btn p-3 rounded-2xl border-2 border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700 hover:border-amber-400 text-left transition-all">
                                <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1">
                                    <span class="text-xs font-bold">Bấc sợi Cotton Organic</span>
                                    <i data-lucide="feather" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-stone-400"></i>
                                </div>
                                <div class="text-[10px] text-stone-500">Cháy tĩnh lặng, ngọn lửa đều</div>
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Bước 3: Chọn tầng hương chủ đạo -->
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-300 mb-2.5">
                            Bước 3: Chọn công thức tầng hương chữa lành
                        </label>
                        <select id="scentSelect" onchange="updateCustomizerScent(this.value)" class="w-full text-xs p-3 rounded-xl border border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-700 bg-white dark:bg-stone-800 font-medium">
                            <option value="Lavender & Sandalwood">Oải hương êm dịu & Gỗ đàn hương (Thư giãn, ngủ sâu)</option>
                            <option value="Vanilla & Cinnamon">Vani ngọt ngào & Quế cay ấm (Cảm giác được ôm ấp)</option>
                            <option value="Citrus & Jasmine">Cam Bergamot & Hoa nhài thanh khiết (Bừng tỉnh năng lượng)</option>
                            <option value="White Tea & Cedarwood">Trà trắng sương mai & Tuyết tùng (Tập trung làm việc)</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Bước 4: Nhập nội dung in nhãn cá nhân hóa (Personalized Label) -->
                    <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-stone-50 dark:bg-stone-800/60 border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-700 space-y-3">
                        <label class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-400">
                            Bước 4: Khắc tên & Thông điệp riêng (Live On-Label Preview)
                        </label>
                        
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                            <div>
                                <span class="text-[11px] text-stone-500 font-medium block mb-1">Tên người nhận / Biệt danh:</span>
                                <input type="text" id="inputRecipient" value="Hoàng Lan" oninput="updateLiveLabel()" placeholder="Ví dụ: Hoàng Lan / My Dearest" class="w-full text-xs p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-600 bg-white dark:bg-stone-800 font-medium">
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <span class="text-[11px] text-stone-500 font-medium block mb-1">Cung hoàng đạo (Zodiac Icon):</span>
                                <select id="inputZodiac" onchange="updateLiveLabel()" class="w-full text-xs p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-600 bg-white dark:bg-stone-800 font-medium">
                                    <option value="♈ Bạch Dương (Aries)">♈ Bạch Dương (Aries)</option>
                                    <option value="♉ Kim Ngưu (Taurus)">♉ Kim Ngưu (Taurus)</option>
                                    <option value="♊ Song Tử (Gemini)">♊ Song Tử (Gemini)</option>
                                    <option value="♋ Cự Giải (Cancer)">♋ Cự Giải (Cancer)</option>
                                    <option value="♌ Sư Tử (Leo)">♌ Sư Tử (Leo)</option>
                                    <option value="♍ Xử Nữ (Virgo)" selected>♍ Xử Nữ (Virgo)</option>
                                    <option value="♎ Thiên Bình (Libra)">♎ Thiên Bình (Libra)</option>
                                    <option value="♏ Bọ Cạp (Scorpio)">♏ Bọ Cạp (Scorpio)</option>
                                    <option value="♐ Nhân Mã (Sagittarius)">♐ Nhân Mã (Sagittarius)</option>
                                    <option value="♑ Ma Kết (Capricorn)">♑ Ma Kết (Capricorn)</option>
                                    <option value="♒ Bảo Bình (Aquarius)">♒ Bảo Bình (Aquarius)</option>
                                    <option value="♓ Song Ngư (Pisces)">♓ Song Ngư (Pisces)</option>
                                </select>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div>
                            <span class="text-[11px] text-stone-500 font-medium block mb-1">Thông điệp in dưới nhãn:</span>
                            <input type="text" id="inputMessage" value="Mong bạn luôn an yên và ngập tràn hạnh phúc" oninput="updateLiveLabel()" placeholder="Gõ lời chúc ngọt ngào của bạn..." class="w-full text-xs p-2.5 rounded-lg border border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-600 bg-white dark:bg-stone-800 font-medium">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Cột phải: Live Preview Hũ nến trực quan -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-stone-900 text-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-2xl flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden border border-stone-700">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-3 border-b border-stone-800">
                        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-400 font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5">
                            <i data-lucide="eye" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i>
                            Live Preview Thời Gian Thực
                        </span>
                        <!-- Nút dập / thắp nến -->
                        <button onclick="toggleCandleFlame()" class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-stone-800 hover:bg-stone-700 text-stone-300 border border-stone-700 transition-all">
                            Thắp / Thổi tắt ngọn lửa
                        </button>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Khung mô phỏng hũ nến thực tế -->
                    <div class="py-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-[340px]">
                        <!-- Ngọn lửa -->
                        <div id="customFlame" class="w-6 h-12 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-t from-amber-600 via-amber-400 to-yellow-100 candle-flame mb-2 shadow-amber-500/50"></div>
                        <!-- Bấc nến -->
                        <div id="customWickView" class="w-2 h-3.5 bg-amber-950 rounded-sm"></div>

                        <!-- Thân hũ nến tùy biến -->
                        <div id="candleBody" class="w-64 h-72 rounded-3xl p-4 shadow-2xl border transition-all duration-500 flex flex-col justify-center items-center bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-900 via-stone-900 to-stone-950 border-amber-700/50">
                            <!-- Nhãn nến thay đổi theo thời gian thực -->
                            <div class="w-52 h-56 border border-amber-300/40 p-4 rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between items-center bg-stone-950/80 backdrop-blur-md text-center shadow-inner">
                                <div class="text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-300 font-bold border-b border-amber-400/20 pb-1.5 w-full">
                                    LUMEN & SCENT HANDMADE
                                </div>
                                <div class="my-auto space-y-1.5 px-1">
                                    <div id="previewRecipient" class="text-2xl font-heading italic text-amber-200">Hoàng Lan</div>
                                    <div id="previewMessage" class="text-[10px] text-amber-100/90 font-light italic">"Mong bạn luôn an yên và ngập tràn hạnh phúc"</div>
                                    <div id="previewZodiac" class="text-xs text-amber-400 font-semibold pt-1">
                                        ♍ Xử Nữ (Virgo)
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="text-[8px] uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-300/70 border-t border-amber-400/20 pt-1.5 w-full">
                                    <span id="previewScent">Lavender & Sandalwood</span> • 200g
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Chi tiết giá & Nút thêm vào giỏ hàng -->
                    <div class="pt-4 border-t border-stone-800 space-y-3">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                            <span class="text-xs text-stone-400">Tổng giá hũ nến custom:</span>
                            <span id="customizerPrice" class="text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-amber-400">289.000 VNĐ</span>
                        </div>
                        <button onclick="addCustomCandleToCart()" class="w-full py-3.5 rounded-custom font-bold text-stone-900 bg-amber-400 hover:bg-amber-300 active:scale-95 transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shadow-lg">
                            <i data-lucide="shopping-bag" class="w-5 h-5"></i>
                            <span>Thêm Hũ Nến Custom Này Vào Giỏ Hàng</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ======================================================== -->
    <!-- 4. EXTENSION 2: SCENT FINDER QUIZ (GỢI Ý MÙI THEO TÂM TRẠNG) -->
    <!-- ======================================================== -->
    <section id="quiz" class="py-16 theme-surface">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-900 via-stone-900 to-amber-950 text-white rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-2xl border border-amber-700/30 relative overflow-hidden">
                <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center space-y-4">
                    <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 border border-amber-400/30">
                        Extension 2: Smart Scent Quiz
                    </span>
                    <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold font-heading">Trắc Nghiệm Tâm Trạng: Tìm Hương Thơm "Chữa Lành"</h2>
                    <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-300">
                        Bạn đang mệt mỏi sau deadline, cần sự lãng mạn hay tìm kiếm giấc ngủ ngon? Hãy để thuật toán matching tầng hương của chúng tôi giúp bạn.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Step Container -->
                <div id="quizContainer" class="mt-8 bg-stone-900/80 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-stone-800">
                    <!-- Câu hỏi 1 -->
                    <div id="quizStep1" class="space-y-4">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-amber-400 font-semibold mb-2">
                            <span>Câu hỏi 1 / 3: Tâm trạng của bạn hôm nay?</span>
                            <span>33%</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                            <button onclick="answerQuiz(1, 'stress')" class="quiz-btn p-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-700 hover:border-amber-400 bg-stone-800/50 text-left hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all">
                                <div class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1">😫 Stress, ngợp với deadline</div>
                                <div class="text-xs text-stone-400">Cần thư giãn thần kinh, giảm âu lo</div>
                            </button>
                            <button onclick="answerQuiz(1, 'sleep')" class="quiz-btn p-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-700 hover:border-amber-400 bg-stone-800/50 text-left hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all">
                                <div class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1">🌙 Mất ngủ, trằn trọc khó vào giấc</div>
                                <div class="text-xs text-stone-400">Cần không gian êm dịu, vỗ về</div>
                            </button>
                            <button onclick="answerQuiz(1, 'focus')" class="quiz-btn p-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-700 hover:border-amber-400 bg-stone-800/50 text-left hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all">
                                <div class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1">💡 Cần tập trung cao độ</div>
                                <div class="text-xs text-stone-400">Học bài, đọc sách, làm việc sâu</div>
                            </button>
                            <button onclick="answerQuiz(1, 'romance')" class="quiz-btn p-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-700 hover:border-amber-400 bg-stone-800/50 text-left hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all">
                                <div class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1">🌹 Hẹn hò lãng mạn, ấm cúng</div>
                                <div class="text-xs text-stone-400">Không gian ngọt ngào bên người ấy</div>
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Câu hỏi 2 -->
                    <div id="quizStep2" class="hidden space-y-4">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-amber-400 font-semibold mb-2">
                            <span>Câu hỏi 2 / 3: Không gian bạn thắp nến?</span>
                            <span>66%</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                            <button onclick="answerQuiz(2, 'desk')" class="quiz-btn p-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-700 hover:border-amber-400 bg-stone-800/50 text-left hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all">
                                <div class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1">🖥️ Bàn làm việc / học tập cá nhân</div>
                            </button>
                            <button onclick="answerQuiz(2, 'bedroom')" class="quiz-btn p-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-700 hover:border-amber-400 bg-stone-800/50 text-left hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all">
                                <div class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1">🛏️ Phòng ngủ ấm cúng</div>
                            </button>
                            <button onclick="answerQuiz(2, 'bath')" class="quiz-btn p-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-700 hover:border-amber-400 bg-stone-800/50 text-left hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all">
                                <div class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1">🛁 Bồn tắm thư giãn</div>
                            </button>
                            <button onclick="answerQuiz(2, 'living')" class="quiz-btn p-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-700 hover:border-amber-400 bg-stone-800/50 text-left hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all">
                                <div class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1">🛋️ Phòng khách / không gian mở</div>
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Câu hỏi 3 -->
                    <div id="quizStep3" class="hidden space-y-4">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-amber-400 font-semibold mb-2">
                            <span>Câu hỏi 3 / 3: Tông mùi hương bạn thích nhất?</span>
                            <span>100%</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                            <button onclick="answerQuiz(3, 'wood')" class="quiz-btn p-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-700 hover:border-amber-400 bg-stone-800/50 text-left hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all">
                                <div class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1">🌲 Gỗ trầm ấm & Khói nhẹ (Woody)</div>
                            </button>
                            <button onclick="answerQuiz(3, 'floral')" class="quiz-btn p-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-700 hover:border-amber-400 bg-stone-800/50 text-left hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all">
                                <div class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1">🌸 Hoa cỏ dịu mát tự nhiên (Floral)</div>
                            </button>
                            <button onclick="answerQuiz(3, 'sweet')" class="quiz-btn p-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-700 hover:border-amber-400 bg-stone-800/50 text-left hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all">
                                <div class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1">🍦 Vani ngọt ngào & Bánh quế (Gourmand)</div>
                            </button>
                            <button onclick="answerQuiz(3, 'citrus')" class="quiz-btn p-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-700 hover:border-amber-400 bg-stone-800/50 text-left hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all">
                                <div class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1">🍋 Cam chanh tươi mát & Trà trắng (Fresh)</div>
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Kết quả Quiz -->
                    <div id="quizResult" class="hidden text-center space-y-6">
                        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-semibold">
                            <i data-lucide="check" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                            Công thức mùi hương được đề xuất cho bạn
                        </div>
                        
                        <h3 id="resultTitle" class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-amber-300">
                            "Deep Slumber No.04" (Giấc Ngủ Sâu & Bình Yên)
                        </h3>

                        <!-- Scent Pyramid (Kim tự tháp 3 tầng hương) -->
                        <div class="max-w-md mx-auto bg-stone-800/60 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-stone-700 text-xs space-y-2 text-left">
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-1.5 border-b border-stone-700">
                                <span class="text-stone-400 font-semibold">Top Notes (Tầng hương đầu):</span>
                                <span id="resultTop" class="text-amber-200 font-medium">Cam Bergamot & Hoa cúc La Mã</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-1.5 border-b border-stone-700">
                                <span class="text-stone-400 font-semibold">Heart Notes (Tầng hương giữa):</span>
                                <span id="resultHeart" class="text-amber-200 font-medium">Oải hương Pháp & Xô thơm</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                                <span class="text-stone-400 font-semibold">Base Notes (Tầng hương cuối):</span>
                                <span id="resultBase" class="text-amber-200 font-medium">Gỗ tuyết tùng & Hổ phách ấm</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4 pt-2">
                            <button onclick="applyQuizToCustomizer()" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold bg-amber-400 text-stone-900 hover:bg-amber-300 transition-all flex items-center gap-2">
                                <i data-lucide="wand-2" class="w-4 h-4"></i>
                                <span>Áp dụng công thức này vào Hũ nến Custom</span>
                            </button>
                            <button onclick="resetQuiz()" class="px-4 py-3 rounded-xl font-medium text-xs text-stone-400 hover:text-white">
                                Làm lại trắc nghiệm
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ======================================================== -->
    <!-- 5. EXTENSION 3: GIFT BOX BUNDLE BUILDER (BÁN CHÉO COMBO) -->
    <!-- ======================================================== -->
    <section id="bundle" class="py-16 theme-surface border-t border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
                <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-white" style="background-color: var(--primary-color);">
                    Extension 3: Smart Gift Bundle Builder
                </span>
                <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold mt-3 mb-2">Bộ Phụ Kiện & Hộp Quà Tặng Sang Trọng</h2>
                <p class="text-sm text-theme-subtext">
                    Nâng niu từng trải nghiệm thắp nến. Thêm phụ kiện chăm sóc nến chuyên dụng để được giảm ngay 15% tổng hóa đơn combo.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
                <!-- Addon 1: Kéo cắt bấc nến -->
                <div class="addon-card p-5 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 bg-white dark:bg-stone-900 shadow-md flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <div class="w-full h-36 rounded-xl bg-amber-100/60 dark:bg-stone-800 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
                            <i data-lucide="scissors" class="w-12 h-12 text-amber-700"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-sm mb-1">Kéo Cắt Bấc Nến Mạ Vàng</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mb-3">Giữ bấc nến dài chuẩn 5mm để ngọn lửa cháy tròn trịa và không sinh muội than.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-3 border-t border-stone-100 dark:border-stone-800">
                        <span class="font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 text-sm">65.000 VNĐ</span>
                        <label class="flex items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer text-xs font-semibold">
                            <input type="checkbox" onchange="toggleBundleItem('wickTrimmer', 65000, 'Kéo cắt bấc nến mạ vàng')" class="rounded text-amber-600 focus:ring-amber-500 w-4 h-4">
                            <span>Thêm vào</span>
                        </label>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Addon 2: Chuông dập lửa nến -->
                <div class="addon-card p-5 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 bg-white dark:bg-stone-900 shadow-md flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <div class="w-full h-36 rounded-xl bg-amber-100/60 dark:bg-stone-800 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
                            <i data-lucide="bell" class="w-12 h-12 text-amber-700"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-sm mb-1">Chuông Dập Lửa Chống Khói</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mb-3">Tắt nến không cần thổi, ngăn chặn hoàn toàn khói đen và bảo vệ tinh dầu nến.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-3 border-t border-stone-100 dark:border-stone-800">
                        <span class="font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 text-sm">55.000 VNĐ</span>
                        <label class="flex items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer text-xs font-semibold">
                            <input type="checkbox" onchange="toggleBundleItem('snuffer', 55000, 'Chuông dập lửa nến')" class="rounded text-amber-600 focus:ring-amber-500 w-4 h-4">
                            <span>Thêm vào</span>
                        </label>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Addon 3: Hộp diêm que dài nghệ thuật -->
                <div class="addon-card p-5 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 bg-white dark:bg-stone-900 shadow-md flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <div class="w-full h-36 rounded-xl bg-amber-100/60 dark:bg-stone-800 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
                            <i data-lucide="flame" class="w-12 h-12 text-amber-700"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-sm mb-1">Hộp Diêm Dài Vintage 10cm</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mb-3">Diêm gỗ quẹt êm, que dài 10cm an toàn khi thắp các hũ nến đã cháy sâu xuống đáy.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-3 border-t border-stone-100 dark:border-stone-800">
                        <span class="font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 text-sm">25.000 VNĐ</span>
                        <label class="flex items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer text-xs font-semibold">
                            <input type="checkbox" onchange="toggleBundleItem('vintageMatches', 25000, 'Hộp diêm dài vintage 10cm')" class="rounded text-amber-600 focus:ring-amber-500 w-4 h-4">
                            <span>Thêm vào</span>
                        </label>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Addon 4: Hộp quà kraft & Thiệp niêm sáp -->
                <div class="addon-card p-5 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 bg-white dark:bg-stone-900 shadow-md flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <div class="w-full h-36 rounded-xl bg-amber-100/60 dark:bg-stone-800 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
                            <i data-lucide="package" class="w-12 h-12 text-amber-700"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-sm mb-1">Set Hộp Quà & Thiệp Niêm Sáp</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mb-3">Hộp quà carton cứng cáp lót rơm gỗ, thắt nơ ruy băng lụa và thiệp viết tay theo yêu cầu.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-3 border-t border-stone-100 dark:border-stone-800">
                        <span class="font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 text-sm">39.000 VNĐ</span>
                        <label class="flex items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer text-xs font-semibold">
